@emph{Exercise 4.44a is added by this edition and extends exercise 4.44; SICP numbers stop at 4.44.} @strong{@anchor{Exercise 4.44a}Exercise 4.44a:} The edition's evaluator
counts backtracks: one for every delivery of the @code{Fail} effect to a
